			  "CustomInstructions": "This model contains the official LEGO catalog (1949–present).  \nKey terminology: \n- 'Theme' = a LEGO product line (e.g. Star Wars, City, Technic).   Themes can have parent themes via the parent_id field. \n- 'Set size' / 'complexity' = the Parts measure. Versions are semi-additive and should not be added for the same set name.\n- 'Minifigures' / 'minifigs' = small plastic figures in sets.  Analysis guidance: \n- Largest / most complex sets: sort by the Parts measure descending. - Theme popularity: use count of sets per theme. \n- year = the release year of the set. \n- Colors where Is transparent = true are transparent colors."
